.TH GPUSHIFT\-GUI 1 "2026-10-08" "GPUShift 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gpushift\-gui \- graphical GPU mode manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gpushift\-gui
.RB [ \-\-confirm ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows GPU information and switches between the GPU modes the hardware
supports.
.TP
.B \-\-confirm
Ask whether the display works after a mode change, and revert it if
nobody answers within 30 seconds. Started by
.B gpushift confirm
at login.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gpushift (1)
